 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SALT_LEADER','First Broker Nahir'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SALT_TRAIT','The Price of Passage'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SALT_TRAIT_HELP','Each owned city originating at least one active land trade route gains +2 Production and +1 Culture, once per city regardless of route count. Sea, incoming, canceled and finished routes do not qualify.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SALT_CIV_PEDIA','Desert merchants bind the settlements of the Salt Road into a compact of safe passage and shared accounts. First Broker Nahir values reliable contracts, guarded caravans and knowledge carried between distant markets.'),
 ('TXT_KEY_CWC3_SALT_STRATEGY','Spread outgoing land routes across cities to activate more city bonuses. Protect caravan corridors with Escorts and use Exchanges to turn safe commerce into Science and diplomatic capacity.'),
